---
banner: /assets/img/photos/banner-dates-and-events.jpg
title: Dates & Events
lede: Feasts, fasts, and parish observances for the church year ahead.
description: Calendar of Orthodox feasts, fasts, and parish events at Saint Elizabeth Orthodox Church in Poulsbo.
---

<p>Our <a href="/what-we-do/worship/">regular weekly schedule</a> changes during certain seasons of the church year. Below are the feasts, fasts, and parish events for the year ahead.</p>

{% if not calendar.configured %}
  <div class="notice">
    <strong>The parish calendar is not connected yet.</strong>
    Add the parish Google Calendar's ID to <code>googleCalendarId</code> in
    <code>src/_data/site.json</code> and this page will fill itself in. See
    <code>docs/calendar-setup.md</code> for step-by-step instructions.
  </div>
{% elif calendar.error %}
  <div class="notice">
    <strong>We could not load the calendar just now.</strong>
    Please check back shortly, or call the parish at
    <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneHref }}">{{ site.phone }}</a>.
  </div>
{% elif not calendar.events.length %}
  <p>There are no events on the parish calendar for the coming year yet.</p>
{% else %}
  <ul class="calendar">
    {% for item in calendar.events %}
      <li>
        <time datetime="{{ item.date }}">{{ item.date | feastDate }}</time>
        <span>
          {{ item.title }}
          {% if not item.allDay %}<span class="calendar-meta">{{ item.start | eventTime }}</span>{% endif %}
          {% if item.location %}<span class="calendar-meta">{{ item.location }}</span>{% endif %}
        </span>
        <span class="tag tag-{{ item.kind }}">{{ item.kind }}</span>
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>

  <p class="small">
    Times are {{ site.address.city }} local time. The calendar is maintained in Google Calendar; this
    page updates on the next site build.
  </p>
{% endif %}
